# Shell scripts must stay LF even though this repo is authored on Windows —
# real bash/sh chokes on CRLF regardless of platform. ios/ci_scripts/*.sh
# runs on Xcode Cloud's macOS shell specifically; setup-wizard.sh had
# silently picked up CRLF at some point (fixed by this file), which would
# break it for anyone who runs it outside Git Bash's CRLF-tolerant shebang
# handling (e.g. via WSL, or `bash setup-wizard.sh` on a Mac).
*.sh text eol=lf
